{"synopsis":"Sejak Raja Zhou naik takhta, ia terobsesi dengan kecantikan Ratu Daji yang mempesona, memungut pajak yang berat dan menindas rakyat. Namun suatu hari, binatang suci Dinasti Shang, Naga Kura-kura, tiba-tiba mati, dan perebutan takhta resmi dimulai! Nantikan kelanjutannya hanya di Soulscans.my.id\n\nAlkisah di suatu dinasti yang rajanya hari-hari cuma hohohihe, tidak peduli dengan rakyatnya. Akhirnya MC lahir dan menjadi malapetaka bagi raja tersebut.","alternative_title":"天子传奇【重制版】","author":"拾部","artist":"拾部","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6a498cb6-3c10-4f71-a105-8b04226dbe2e","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9cfdfd8b-e95e-4d0e-a525-be04f514aa46/chapter_ch_50/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"520e45d1-9512-4a50-8b25-b664974e85a4","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07